.TH "KC" "1" "Jan 0001" "kc dev" "kc Manual"

.SH NAME
kc-history - List the recorded previous values of a secret


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkc history KEY [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists every version kc recorded before a value was overwritten or deleted.
Values are shown as digests only — read one with \fBkc get KEY --version N\fR,
restore one with \fBkc rollback KEY --version N\fR\&.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for history

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output structured JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--vault\fP=""
	target vault (overrides active vault)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBkc(1)\fP
